<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 123 0 R
/E (The color binocular Velociraptor VRD series pairs 5 MP 3D point cloud technology with DLP structured-light imaging, built for 3D guidance on collaborative robot arms. It outputs RGB color images to raise both surface-inspection and product-segmentation efficiency. Its binocular imaging cuts occlusions and sharpens depth perception, holding up in complex industrial settings. A flexible design meets industrial standards and resists vibration, shock, and ambient light, delivering a stable, efficient cobot-guidance solution for high-dynamic production lines.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [8]
>>
